+# 9. WebSocket događaji
+
+GUI dobija promjene uživo preko jednog WebSocket kanala.
+
+Envelope:
+
+```json
+{
+  "schema_version": 1,
+  "event_id": "uuid",
+  "type": "session.updated",
+  "occurred_at": "2026-07-31T10:45:18Z",
+  "project_id": "uuid",
+  "payload": {}
