+```
+
+Početni događaji:
+
+```text
+service.ready
+project.updated
+task.updated
+plan.imported
+plan.activated
+plan_item.updated
+plan_item.criterion.updated
+plan_progress.updated
+project.resume.updated
+project.reconciliation.created
+project.reconciliation.resolved
+external_activity.created
+session.created
+session.updated
+session.completed
+file_activity.created
+conflict.created
+conflict.updated
